style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 3.1.23 was =
released<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We are now in feature freeze =
for 4.2. There are some patches which we will take in M4 such as the CVE =
fetching changes.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We now have the ability to =
track regression changes between releases using resulttool for example =
with a command like &#8220;</span><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:#2E3436;background:white'>y=
octo_testresults_query.py regression-report 4.2_M1 4.2_M2&#8221;. This =
did already spot one regression in quilt ptest which we&#8217;ve tracked =
down and fixed.</span><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:#2E3436;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 =
level1 lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;background:white'>A regression =
report was included with M3 using the above tool automatically: =
</span><span style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'><a =
href=3D"https://autobuilder.yocto.io/pub/releases/yocto-4.2_M3.rc1/testre=
sults/testresult-regressions-report.txt"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC;background:white'>https://autobuilder.yocto.io/pub=
/releases/yocto-4.2_M3.rc1/testresults/testresult-regressions-report.txt<=
/span></a><span style=3D'background:white'> - some tweaks are needed but =
it is good progress.</span><o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>CVE levels in master look much =
better, thanks to everyone who helped. We are in the process of =
including kernel CVEs in these reports for master going =
forward.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have a growing number of =
bugs in bugzilla, any help with them is =
appreciated.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have had patches from a few =
new submitters, this is very very much appreciated and great to see. =
Some bugs have moved forward as a result of this. All of these changes =
combine together to make the project what it =
is!<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>Ways to =
